('GAB', '266', 'Gabon', 11.7, -0.7, 45, 30, 45, 40, 20, array['Mn','Fe','Au','Crude']::text[], 'Second-largest manganese ore exporter. The 2023 coup leader won the 2025 election; government intends to ban manganese ore exports from 2029 to force local processing.', array['Manganese export-ban timeline and Comilog processing investment','Transgabonais railway reliability']::text[], '[["2029", "Planned ban on manganese ore exports"]]'::jsonb, array['metals','energy']::text[], 'africa'),
