('SDN', '729', 'Sudan', 30, 15.5, 95, 98, 85, 90, 80, array['Au','Crude']::text[], 'Civil war since April 2023. Gold funds both sides and leaves largely through informal channels to the Gulf. No formal corridor is reliable.', array['Gold smuggling routes and sanctions exposure for Gulf refiners','Port Sudan control']::text[], '[]'::jsonb, array['metals','energy']::text[], 'africa'),
